{"tool_name":"bise","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"BISE","home":"https://biii.eu","license":"Other","summary":"BIII (BioImage Informatics Index, biii.eu) is a registry of software tools, image databases for benchmarking, and training materials for bioimage analysis. Software tools are organized as either a full protocol of analysis (workflow), a specific component to construct a workflow, or a software platform or library (collection). They are described using EDAM-bioimaging. All entries are exposed following FAIR principles and accessible for other usage with ODC-By v1.0 license.","addition_date":"2019-11-05T10:22:46Z","last_update_date":"2021-03-26T15:45:10Z","tool_type":["Bioinformatics portal","Database portal","Web application"],"collections":["NEUBIAS","elixir-fr-sdp-2019"],"accessibility":"Open access","biotools_curie":"biotools:BISE","cost":"Free of charge","credit":[{"email":"perrine.paul-gilloteaux@univ-nantes.fr","name":"Perrine Paul-Gilloteaux","note":"Leader of the project","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4822-165X","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]},{"name":"Alban Gaignard","note":"Developed the core ontology (data model) and enabled reuse of the content through W3C standards","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3597-8557","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Contributor"]},{"name":"Florian Levet","note":"Development of Python scripts","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4009-6225","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Contributor"]},{"name":"Kota Miura","note":"Main technical support and one of the founders of the project","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6926-191X","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Contributor"]},{"name":"Leandro Scholz","note":"Worked on the curation instructions","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2411-0429","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Contributor"]},{"name":"Mat\u00fa\u0161 Kala\u0161","note":"Coordinator of the EDAM-bioimaging ontology